sease in Nigeria school children</article-title><source>Nig J Ophthalmol</source><year>2001</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>6</fpage><lpage>9</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="R9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Foster</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Minassian</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name><name><surname>Weale</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>West</surname><given-names>SK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prevalence, incidence and distribution of visual impairment</article-title><source>Epidemiology of eye disease</source><year>2003</year><edition>2nd ed</edition><publisher-loc>London</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Arnold publishers</publisher-name><fpage>3</fpage><lpage>28</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="R10"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="thesis"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Isawumi</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Ocular disorders among school children in Osun State, Nigeria</article-title><source>Dissertation for the award of Fellowship Diploma of the National Postgraduate Medical College of Nigeria in Ophthalmology</source><year>2003</year></element-citation></ref><ref id="R11"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="thesis"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ugochukwu</surname><given-names>CIO</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Survey of eye health status of primary school children in Nkanu West Local Government Area of Enugu State, Nigeria</article-title><source>Dissertation for the award of Fellowship Diploma of the National Postgraduate Medical College 